{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Visit the Little Witch Carnival!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The club carnival parade has devolved into total chaos! As a freshman caught in the middle of it all, use your magic to survive the wild competition of talent shows as clubs go all out to outshine each other!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adorable little witch, exquisite dynamic pixel art;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich and distinct upgrades, high freedom in build customization. Explore unique effects from different combinations to craft your own one-of-a-kind playstyle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of cute and quirky enemies with unique behaviors, paired with meticulously designed, diverse levels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced gameplay under 20 minutes\u2014perfect for quick sessions anytime to relax your mind.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557270?t=1744165008","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/ea1b607170b13eed12d4f91d771c8fa85876d97c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744165008","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/19930166c9ea3edba7b94425b8727e475ec2a5d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744165008","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/19930166c9ea3edba7b94425b8727e475ec2a5d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744165008","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Visit the Little Witch Carnival!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The club carnival parade has devolved into total chaos! As a freshman caught in the middle of it all, use your magic to survive the wild competition of talent shows as clubs go all out to outshine each other!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adorable little witch, exquisite dynamic pixel art;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich and distinct upgrades, high freedom in build customization. Explore unique effects from different combinations to craft your own one-of-a-kind playstyle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of cute and quirky enemies with unique behaviors, paired with meticulously designed, diverse levels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced gameplay under 20 minutes\u2014perfect for quick sessions anytime to relax your mind.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Kanata Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/4efe9ebccce7cb20849cb4dcee1579bf8214c09a/header.jpg?t=1744165008","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Little Witch's Carnival","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> </li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Kanata Game"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":""},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/e17acfa74185d2895191b3609ada9d803d1e7fe7/ss_e17acfa74185d2895191b3609ada9d803d1e7fe7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744165008","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557270/e17acfa74185d2895191b3609a